        rdfs:comment    "General: Cannot find any article or acceptable evidence to name a specific adenylate cyclase playing a role in OXM-dependent regulation of insulin production via GLP1R. The problem is that OXM is a biased agonist of GLP1R, i.e. binds the receptor as GLP1 but downstream effects are different." ;
