:6ab067da00007979  a    owl:NamedIndividual , obo:ECO_0000304 ;
        rdfs:comment    "Justification for evidence: TAS used instead of ISS because I cannot access full text and I do not know which animals have been used for in vivo measurements of insulin secretion. From the abstract it is clear that insulin secretion is stimulated by oxyntomodulin binding to GLP-1 receptor and activation of the α subunit of heterotrimeric G protein and cAMP accumulation." ;
